    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to present this beautifully maintained 3 bedroom, 1 bathroom semi-detached residence, presented in pristine condition throughout and ideally located within walking distance of all local amenities.\n\nSituated in a mature and well-established residential development, the property enjoys a prime location in the heritage town of Listowel, with primary and secondary schools, shops, cafés, pubs, restaurants and a wide range of local amenities all within easy walking distance.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises an entrance porch, welcoming hallway, spacious lounge/sitting room, kitchen/dining room and utility room. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms and a modern family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property is approached via a gated entrance providing ample off-street parking. A side gate offers secure access to the enclosed rear garden, creating an ideal space for children, pets and outdoor entertaining. Both the front and rear gardens have been attractively paved, providing a low-maintenance outdoor setting.\n\nA detached garage extending to approximately 18 sq.m. offers excellent additional storage or workshop space.\n\nFurther benefits include oil-fired central heating, double-glazed uPVC windows and doors throughout, and mains connections to all essential services.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition, this impressive home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors seeking a property in a highly convenient location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.62m x 0.52m\nwith sliding door & ceramic floor tiles\n\nEntrance Hallway - 4.16m x 1.83m\nwith ceramic tiles & understairs storage\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 3.86m x 3.43m\nwith electric fire, laminate flooring, fitted units & window\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.39m x 3.47m\nfitted kitchen with integrated oven & hob, wall & floor tiles & window\n\nUtility Room - 4.33m x 1.48m\nplumbed for appliances, floor tiles, wooden shelving, door to rear\n\nLanding - 2.63m x 1.987m\nwith laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.47m x 3.20m\ndouble with fitted units, laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.73m x 3.29m\ndouble with laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.61m x 2.59m\nsingle with fitted units, laminate flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 1.93m x 1.66m\nTriton T90 SR electric shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nOutbuilding - 3.73m x 4.94m\nwith pedestrian door and garage door\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully maintained 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom semi-detached residence</li><li>Located in a mature and well-established residential development</li><li>Within easy walking distance of schools, shops, cafés, pubs, restaurants and all local amenities</li><li>Three generously proportioned first-floor bedrooms with modern family bathroom</li><li>Gated entrance with ample off-street parking</li><li>Enclosed, low-maintenance rear garden with secure side access</li><li>Front and rear gardens attractively paved for ease of maintenance</li><li>Detached garage (approx. 18 sq.m.) ideal for storage or workshop use</li><li>Oil-fired central heating</li><li>Double-glazed uPVC windows and doors throughout</li><li>Mains water, electricity and sewerage services</li><li>Fibre broadband available </li><li>Excellent choice for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors</ul>"
      },
